{"id":"wb-8-250","name":"五台山南山寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"南山寺 (五台山)","text":"南山寺，系佑国寺、极乐寺、善德堂三处合称，是一座大型佛教寺院，位于山西省五台山风景名胜区台怀镇南2公里杨柏峪村村民小组，南坡山腰间，海拔1700米，清水河从山脚下流过。已列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%97%E5%B1%B1%E5%AF%BA_(%E4%BA%94%E5%8F%B0%E5%B1%B1)","revisionId":86555651,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86555651","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核名称、所在地与对应遗址；原名录行政地址及参考点位不作为唯一判断依据","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/a6b3cc36d551d57620666723.jpg","title":"Wutaishannanshansi.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wutaishannanshansi.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/09/Wutaishannanshansi.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Brookqi","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​山西五台山南山寺","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"南山寺 (五台山)"}}